8,A strain of music that has flourished in India for centuries is being ...,https://vikalpsangam.org/article/a-strain-of-music-that-has-flourished-in-india-for-centuries-is-being-silenced-by-communalism/,"Interviews with jogi families on both sides of Mewat, between Alwar in Rajasthan and Nuh in Haryana, show that their rare musical memories are fast fading because of shifting cultural preferences of the young as well as the loss of performance platforms, especially for the complex ballad tradition. A jogi troupe at Sikrawa in Mewat, Haryana.",Jogi,Indo-European
